Wrong (C): The suspended losses are not frozen; they can offset income from the now-nonpassive activity itself, just not from other passive activities.
Wrong (D): Suspended losses are not permanently disallowed upon a change in participation status; they remain available to offset income from the same activity.$EXPL$
